{"seq":86,"slug":"advanced-ocaml-programming","title":"OCaml 函数式系统编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ocaml-函数式系统编程\">OCaml 函数式系统编程</h1><p>OCaml 占据一个独特的生态位：它既拥有 ML 家族的强类型推断与代数数据类型，又通过原生编译器生成接近 C 的机器码性能，同时在 5.x 系列（截至 2026 年 6 月已达 5.5.0）中引入了基于 Domain 的真正共享内存并行与 Effect Handler 机制。这使它成为少数能同时满足「类型安全」与「系统级性能」的实用语言之一。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦 OCaml 作为系统编程语言的四个支柱：类型系统的表达力（代数类型、GADT、多态）、模块系统的大规模抽象能力（Functor、一等模块、封装模式）、OCaml 5 多核并发模型（Domain/Fiber/Effect Handler/Eio）、以及工具链与工业生态（Opam/Dune/编译器内部/Jane Street 生态）。</p>\n<p>与本仓库其他 hub 的分工边界：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>functional-programming</strong> 讲通用函数式编程概念（不可变性、高阶函数、Monad），不涉及具体语言实现细节</li>\n<li><strong>haskell-pure-functional</strong> 聚焦 Haskell 的纯函数+惰性求值+Monad Transformer 栈，与 OCaml 的严格求值+Effect 模型形成互补视角</li>\n<li><strong>type-systems</strong> 探讨类型论的数学基础（依赖类型、子类型、类型可判定性），本 hub 则侧重 OCaml 类型系统在工程中的实际运用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先从类型系统章节建立 OCaml 的类型思维，再学习模块系统理解大型项目组织方式，然后进入并发与效果章节掌握 OCaml 5 的并行编程模型，最后通过生态工具链章节了解工业实践。</p>\n<p>前置知识：至少一门静态类型语言的编程经验（如 Rust/Haskell/TypeScript），对函数式编程基本概念（递归、模式匹配、不可变数据）有初步了解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-system","title":"类型系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algebraic-types-pattern-matching","title":"代数类型与模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/algebraic-types-pattern-matching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"polymorphism-type-inference","title":"多态与类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/polymorphism-type-inference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gadt-phantom-types","title":"GADT 与幻影类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/gadt-phantom-types"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"module-system","title":"模块系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modules-signatures-functors","title":"模块、签名与函子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/modules-signatures-functors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"first-class-modules","title":"一等公民模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/first-class-modules"},{"seq":3,"slug":"abstraction-encapsulation","title":"抽象与封装模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/abstraction-encapsulation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrency-effects","title":"并发与效果系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multicore-domains-fibers","title":"多核域与纤程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/multicore-domains-fibers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"effect-handlers","title":"效果处理器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/effect-handlers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-io-eio","title":"异步 IO 与 Eio","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/async-io-eio"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ecosystem","title":"生态与工具链","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"opam-dune-toolchain","title":"Opam 与 Dune 工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/ecosystem/opam-dune-toolchain"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ocaml-compiler-internals","title":"OCaml 编译器内部","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/ecosystem/ocaml-compiler-internals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-world-applications","title":"工业应用案例","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/ecosystem/real-world-applications"}]}]}